WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:07.433
[Subtitles by danielsangeo]

00:00:09.435 --> 00:00:12.000
There are no corndogs in hell.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.667
Alright, well, daylight's burning,

00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:16.767
[machine gun fire]
I guess there's no...

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:17.971
Oh! OH!

00:00:18.567 --> 00:00:19.167
Oof!

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:22.767
Will you give me FIVE
SECONDS to turn this around?!

00:00:22.767 --> 00:00:24.200
No, you won't!

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.167
Fuck you!

00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:26.100
Fuck you...

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.267
What the hell?! This one's shut, too?!

00:00:30.267 --> 00:00:32.400
There's not like a little crack...?

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.333
No! There's nothing!

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:36.633
Fine! Abandon ship!

00:00:36.633 --> 00:00:40.033
I've had mixed feelings about
this boat every step of the way.

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:41.967
Is he firing aga--AHH!

00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:45.600
Perfect.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.009
Okay, where is he? I didn't even see him.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.867
I STILL don't see him.

00:00:50.867 --> 00:00:52.000
[machine gun fire]

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:52.614
Whoa!

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:54.487
How does he...?

00:00:55.293 --> 00:00:57.200
Yeah, no, I'm not doing this.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.967
Son of a bitch can't control his
recoil, but he sure can aim straight.

00:01:00.967 --> 00:01:02.867
Of course. Locked.

00:01:02.867 --> 00:01:04.771
That's a BIG-ass lock.

00:01:05.867 --> 00:01:09.367
Hey, I couldn't shoot it, could...? No...

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:11.467
No...

00:01:12.233 --> 00:01:14.100
I mean, yes!

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:17.100
Wow. The power of no-yes.

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:20.933
I'd shoot more doors open if I didn't
think that would just jam up the locks.

00:01:20.933 --> 00:01:23.733
Plus, that would imply
I know where I'm going.

00:01:23.733 --> 00:01:28.433
Oh wow! A Magnum just
lying here in the basement.

00:01:28.433 --> 00:01:30.867
This must be where the staff
plays Russian Roulette.

00:01:30.867 --> 00:01:32.700
Maybe during their lunch break.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:33.467
WHOA!

00:01:33.467 --> 00:01:34.086
AH!

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:35.500
Now, where did y--

00:01:36.767 --> 00:01:39.233
Jeez, this thing stings!

00:01:39.233 --> 00:01:42.400
I wouldn't have used THIS gun
if I had known you were coming,

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:44.500
but convenience won out.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.933
But I also didn't KNOW you
were coming--you didn't knock.

00:01:47.933 --> 00:01:49.500
I mean, what'd you expect me to do,

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:52.233
just shoot through the door
as soon as I heard a noise?

00:01:52.233 --> 00:01:53.967
It looked pretty solid.

00:01:53.967 --> 00:01:58.533
Oh! Maybe THAT'S why the Magnum was there.

00:01:58.533 --> 00:01:59.767
Although, you know what would better

00:01:59.767 --> 00:02:02.467
is if everybody wasn't
trying to FUCKING KILL ME?!

00:02:02.967 --> 00:02:05.533
Ah! Shit, what am I doing?

00:02:05.533 --> 00:02:07.967
Here, let me just calm down...

00:02:07.967 --> 00:02:09.500
...kill everyone...

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:11.567
...then I'll have some time to think.

00:02:11.567 --> 00:02:13.567
But this keeps HAPPENING!

00:02:13.567 --> 00:02:16.633
I need to start thinking
more outside the box on this.

00:02:16.633 --> 00:02:19.333
I mean, I still need to
kill everybody, but--AHH!

00:02:21.333 --> 00:02:22.233
What the hell?

00:02:22.233 --> 00:02:24.933
[Hunter-Chopper firing]
OH! Oh! Oh! Oh!

00:02:24.933 --> 00:02:26.900
WHERE'D THE CHOPPER COME FROM?!

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:28.100
I DIDN'T HEAR ANYTHING!

00:02:30.067 --> 00:02:31.367
FOR FUCK'S SAKE!

00:02:31.367 --> 00:02:32.733
[Hunter-Chopper firing]
Oh! Oh!

00:02:32.733 --> 00:02:39.467
If only I had a high caliber weapon that
could really punch through its armor!

00:02:39.967 --> 00:02:41.500
C'mon... Eat it...

00:02:41.767 --> 00:02:42.800
[Hunter-Chopper firing]
Yeee!

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:45.200
THIS IS BULLSHIT! THOSE WERE GOOD SHOTS!

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.000
I KNOW THOSE WERE GOOD SHOTS!

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:51.300
DAMMIT, WHY DID CIA TAKE AWAY
MY WEAPONS?! I HAD AN RPG!

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.367
"THOSE ARE GOVERNMENT
PROPERTY. I NEED TO TAKE THOSE.

00:02:53.367 --> 00:02:55.133
"NOW HERE'S A REALLY DANGEROUS MISSION."

00:02:55.133 --> 00:02:55.704
MOVE!

00:02:57.267 --> 00:02:59.067
Fuck... Did that come out of him?!

00:02:59.067 --> 00:03:01.233
Oh, I don't even want to THINK about that!

00:03:01.233 --> 00:03:02.367
[Hunter-Chopper charging up]
It's spinning up! Where is it?!

00:03:02.367 --> 00:03:03.300
I don't see it!

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:04.873
[Hunter-Chopper firing]
Ooh-hoo!

00:03:05.467 --> 00:03:06.057
BLAH!

00:03:07.433 --> 00:03:09.500
JESUS CHRIST!

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:10.333
WHERE IS IT?!

00:03:10.333 --> 00:03:11.767
[Hunter-Chopper charging up]
Fucking gravel...!

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.400
AND HE'S SAFE!

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:16.467
YEAH! TRY TO FLY IN HERE, ASSHOLE!

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.900
[loud machine gun fire]
AAAAH! AAAH!

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:21.667
[ears ringing]
I DID IT AGAIN!

00:03:21.667 --> 00:03:23.100
[ears ringing]
IT FEELS AWFUL!

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:25.333
I'm going to be like Grandpa Mitch!

00:03:25.333 --> 00:03:27.967
Well, assuming I live that long!

00:03:27.967 --> 00:03:30.133
I sure PLAN on living that long!

00:03:30.133 --> 00:03:33.633
But fate and I seem to be having
a really abusive relationship.

00:03:33.633 --> 00:03:36.100
Oh! Indoors! We're safe here!

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:37.967
DID YOU HEAR?! WE'RE SAFE HERE!

00:03:37.967 --> 00:03:39.967
WE'RE SAFE! HOORAY!

00:03:39.967 --> 00:03:41.833
OH NO! WE'RE NOT SAFE!

00:03:41.833 --> 00:03:43.567
EVERYTHING'S STILL TERRIBLE!

00:03:43.567 --> 00:03:45.167
LIKE ALL THE OTHER TIMES!

00:03:46.933 --> 00:03:48.403
GET AWAY FROM ME!

00:03:52.367 --> 00:03:54.500
RAAAAH! NO TIME!

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.767
AS SOON AS I'M DONE RELOADING, SOMEBODY
ELSE IS LIKE, "AAH, COME KILL ME!"

00:03:58.533 --> 00:03:59.171
SEE?!

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:06.100
INTELLIGENCE ONLY MEANS SO MUCH
IF YOU HAVE NO TIME TO PREPARE

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.233
AND HAVE TO DO EVERYTHING ON THE SPOT!

00:04:08.233 --> 00:04:10.667
JUST SCREAM AND HOP AROUND
UNTIL YOU'RE SHOT!

00:04:10.667 --> 00:04:12.533
WHAT A GREAT EQUALIZER!

00:04:12.533 --> 00:04:14.367
IT'S NOT GOING TO STOP, EITHER!

00:04:14.367 --> 00:04:19.467
Even RIGHT NOW, I'm giving that chopper
three minutes before it says, "Eh, fuck it,"

00:04:19.467 --> 00:04:21.867
and starts blind firing into the warehouse.

00:04:23.833 --> 00:04:24.648
Christ!

00:04:26.767 --> 00:04:27.433
I'M OUT!

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:30.333
Just kidding.

00:04:30.333 --> 00:04:32.967
I mean, I AM out, but not TOTALLY out.

00:04:32.967 --> 00:04:34.467
Y'know, a technicality.

00:04:34.467 --> 00:04:39.000
See, if I had time to prepare, I could
rig up a mannequin, spray paint it orange,

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.833
attach a motor on wheels to it...

00:04:40.833 --> 00:04:44.600
I'm sure the chopper would light it up for
20 minutes before it realized it's not me.

00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:46.433
But that's not the point here, is it?

00:04:46.433 --> 00:04:49.200
I've got it now. I'm here
to dance for the CIA.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:50.700
See, I thought they were incompetent

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:53.500
because I thought they actually
wanted to DO something.

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:55.367
THAT was my mistake.

00:04:55.367 --> 00:04:57.600
They have teleporters.

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:02.967
If they wanted this over, they could just
teleport the leader into space. Pop. Done.

00:05:02.967 --> 00:05:04.633
But that's an existential threat,

00:05:04.633 --> 00:05:08.833
because if they can solve all
conflict, that makes them superfluous.

00:05:08.833 --> 00:05:11.067
And who knows how long
this has been going on;

00:05:11.067 --> 00:05:14.233
I'm sure they've had
these thoughts years ago

00:05:14.233 --> 00:05:16.300
so I don't know where their minds' at now,

00:05:16.300 --> 00:05:19.633
but it seems to be at the bored god phase.

00:05:19.633 --> 00:05:22.333
[Hunter-Chopper firing]
So, n--AAH AAAAH!

00:05:22.333 --> 00:05:24.870
Yeah, that's what I get for
thinking above my paygrade!

00:05:26.006 --> 00:05:28.467
WELL, IT *USED* TO BE MY PAYGRADE!

00:05:28.467 --> 00:05:30.400
Although my pay was still kind of shit.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:33.820
It's just how the man keeps
you down. With attack-choppers.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:38.133
This isn't doing anything!
We're not communicating at all!

00:05:38.133 --> 00:05:39.700
YOU'RE NOT LISTENING!

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:41.133
HERE! CATCH!

00:05:41.133 --> 00:05:42.413
Oh, great! GREAT!

00:05:42.413 --> 00:05:43.200
Nnnnngh!

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:44.167
[explosion]

00:05:44.167 --> 00:05:46.567
Yeah, yeah. Get it out of your system.

00:05:46.567 --> 00:05:48.467
Okay, I can move this, but...

00:05:48.467 --> 00:05:53.167
I'm getting soft in my old age. The younger
me wouldn't waste a grenade to save time.

00:05:53.167 --> 00:05:56.133
BLAH! WHY YOU GOTTA BE LIKE THAT?!

00:05:56.133 --> 00:05:59.400
YOU'RE JUST MAKING ME REGRET THIS EVEN
MORE KNOWING YOU WOULD'VE MOVED IT!

00:06:01.433 --> 00:06:03.770
WELL, NOW YOU CAN'T! YOU MISSED YOUR CHANCE!

00:06:05.833 --> 00:06:07.767
[gibbering]

00:06:07.767 --> 00:06:09.354
NO ONE UNDERSTANDS ME!

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:15.633
So, yeah. That's the
mission. Not to fight aliens,

00:06:15.633 --> 00:06:19.433
but for the CIA's bosses to
feel something--anything.

00:06:19.433 --> 00:06:24.300
By not giving me what I need, that makes
their hearts beat just a little bit faster.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:28.900
They're so numb to watching agents
die, they need more. And that's me.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:29.408
Fuck...

00:06:29.408 --> 00:06:30.800
[Hunter-Chopper charging up]

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.800
[Hunter-Chopper firing]

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:35.667
Christ, for all I know, they're
the ones piloting the helicopter!

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:37.867
Ngh!

00:06:37.867 --> 00:06:39.833
[machine gun fire]
AAAAH! AAAAH!

00:06:39.833 --> 00:06:43.933
It's like those people who hunt wolves
from a helicopter! Really sporting!

00:06:43.933 --> 00:06:46.000
GIVES YOU THE REAL THRILL OF THE HUNT!

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:48.367
C-fucking-I-A...

00:06:48.367 --> 00:06:49.267
Nope!

00:06:49.267 --> 00:06:52.200
You're being evicted. I don't
even want to hear your excuses.

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:54.800
AAAH! NO! STOP! DDYAAAAAH!

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:58.100
This is my ONLY cover. I HAVE to take it!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:00.100
I hope you guys didn't leave a mess for me!

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:00.867
Okay, you did--OH-HO-HOO!

00:07:00.867 --> 00:07:01.900
[Hunter-Chopper firing]
Okay, you did--OH-HO-HOO!

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.400
Oh! Cover!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:04.700
Wait, what's this?

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:05.567
Does it work?

00:07:07.367 --> 00:07:09.767
JESUS! IT'S STILL NOT GOING THROUGH!

00:07:09.767 --> 00:07:12.700
Well, I saw SOMETHING.
There was an explosion!

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:13.833
PLEASE REMAIN STILL!

00:07:13.833 --> 00:07:17.067
I'M A SCIENTIST! I NEED
TO REPRODUCE MY RESULTS!

00:07:17.067 --> 00:07:19.100
FINDINGS ARE ENCOURAGING!

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:21.933
BUT IT'S NOT ENOUGH SAMPLES!
WE NEED TO BE THOROUGH!

00:07:21.933 --> 00:07:24.467
NO! WHAT ARE YOU DOING?! STOP IT!

00:07:24.467 --> 00:07:26.333
YOU'RE INTRODUCING A NEW VARIABLE!

00:07:26.333 --> 00:07:29.367
IF YOU KEEP THIS UP, YOU'RE
GOING TO SKEW THE RESULTS!

00:07:29.367 --> 00:07:30.267
NO!

00:07:30.267 --> 00:07:31.300
OH, NOW YOU'VE DONE IT!

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:33.432
WE'RE GOING TO HAVE TO START ALL OVER!

00:07:33.432 --> 00:07:36.867
NO! COME BACK! THE
EXPERIMENT'S NOT FINISHED YET!

00:07:36.867 --> 00:07:38.667
Typical test subject...

00:07:38.667 --> 00:07:41.533
This is why science
takes so long. Right here.

00:07:41.533 --> 00:07:43.200
Is he coming back?

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:43.848
Maybe?

00:07:44.833 --> 00:07:45.733
No...

00:07:45.733 --> 00:07:48.633
So if that WAS CIA, that explains a lot.

00:07:48.633 --> 00:07:51.767
It's almost as if I have to
save them from themselves.

00:07:51.767 --> 00:07:53.833
They've grown bored of
killing their own agents,

00:07:53.833 --> 00:07:56.767
but then they do it from the
safest vantage point possible,

00:07:56.767 --> 00:07:58.833
so they deny themselves the rush.

00:07:58.833 --> 00:07:59.400
What's this?

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:03.000
[alarms sound]
Oh! And there it is!

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.433
I just needed to press a button!

00:08:05.433 --> 00:08:07.500
Was that so hard?

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:11.363
Well...yes. Yes, it kind of was.

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:18.667
The CIA should've just put ME in
charge of teleportation technology.

00:08:18.667 --> 00:08:21.046
I would never go insane with power.

